# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Hand-cut 2026-11-07 (Alliance 12-20 zone order): Darkshore's southern and last loops, after the
# Eastern Kingdoms loop (03-loch-modan), which ends on the boat from Stormwind (or the Hearthstone,
# still bound in Auberdine from the first visit). The route notes for both Darkshore visits are in
# 03-darkshore.
#
# Flow: Auberdine (the quests whose work is on these loops) -> Onu at the Grove -> the Master's
# Glaive, Remtravel's dig, Murkdeep's beach -> the Grove -> Auberdine ->
# the naga and the Ruins of Mathystra -> back south (Auberdine, the Grove) -> Volcor -> Auberdine
# (Druids: Cat Form), then Kerlonian's escort south through Darkshore (06-ashenvale).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Auberdine

step Auberdine
  zone Darkshore
  tip From the dock, up to the north end of the village first (Thundris Windweaver, Alanndarian Nightsong by the moonwell, Archaeologist Hollee), then down the main street: the WANTED poster outside the inn, Terenthis at its east end, where the road leaves south. Sentinel Selarin stands beside Terenthis by the flight master; if she isn't there, she has been killed and respawns shortly: wait a moment.
  turnin 97926 optional                       -- Thundris Windweaver, north end of the village: Baros Alexston's reply
  accept 6123 only NightElf,Druid             -- Alanndarian Nightsong
  accept 729                                  -- Archaeologist Hollee
  vendor nearest optional
  accept 4740                                 -- The WANTED poster
  accept 986                                  -- Terenthis
  accept 990                                  -- Sentinel Selarin, beside Terenthis: for Raene Wolfrunner in Astranaar, in the next guide

