step Prospector Remtravel
  tip Remtravel's Excavation lies on the coast south of Murkdeep's beach. Protect the prospector while he searches for the fossil.
  tip Careful: Ambushers appear as he passes certain spots: a scout comes out from under the board ramp, and more scouts come out when he checks the tent.
  turnin 729                                  -- Prospector Remtravel
  accept 731
  complete 731

step Murkdeep's beach
  tip Murkdeep camps on the beach west of the glaive: kill the murlocs at the camp fire; he comes in the third wave with his hound. Four beached remains lie on the beaches west and south-west of Remtravel's Excavation: take them on the way north to his camp.
